# RimAI — Agent Instructions

An assisted-gameplay advisor for RimWorld. The human plays the colony; a cabinet of self-improving LLM ministers (led by the Mayor) sends suggestions to a React+TS dashboard. MVP is suggest-only; per-minister `Auto` graduations come later (M7+).

---

## Repo layout

```
Docs/                   design docs and planning
  DESIGN.md             high-level principles and decision log
  ROADMAP.md            milestones
  TODO.md               actionable tasks
  design/               per-topic design docs
Src/                    all source code
  RimAI.sln
  ApiHost/              ASP.NET host (HTTP + SSE)
  Cabinet/              minister logic (M3+)
  Common/               pure domain types and interfaces (no external deps)
  Dashboard/            React + TypeScript frontend
  GameStateSync/        RIMAPI HTTP polling client
  KnowledgeBase/        RAG guides + cosine vector store
  LlmGateway/           Gemini boundary layer
  StateStore/           briefing aggregates (M1+)
  Tests/
```

